flowchart TB
  accTitle: Supervised media archiving and cataloging pipeline
  accDescr: A read-only iCloud collection moves through supervised preservation checks before a separate indexing layer creates traceable search records.

  subgraph preservation["1 · Preserve the originals"]
    direction LR
    source["Read-only iCloud collection<br/>31,550 photos and videos"] --> batches["Supervised batches"]
    batches --> checks["File checks"]
    checks --> reconcile["Reconcile failures<br/>Log each promotion"]
    reconcile --> library["Organized local library<br/>Preserved originals"]
  end

  subgraph indexing["2 · Build a separate search layer"]
    direction LR
    parser["Media parser"] --> frames["Photos and video frames"]
    frames --> records["Searchable text and tags"]
    records --> provenance["Source references<br/>Processing provenance"]
  end

  preservation -->|Index separately| indexing

